      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DARK NOISE (1) jumped from this box and scored in quick time latest (24.62) at Goulburn over 440m in a Grade 4/5. Has good early burn and suited drawn the inside. Key chance again here. TARAWI SUSHI (2) was a strong winner last time by 2.5 lengths at Richmond in Grade 5 in one of the quickest times on the program (29.88). Has been out the placings in all two runs here. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. IMPRESS MOANA (7) continued her winning form with another strong run to make it two on the bounce, scoring at The Gardens over 515m (29.55). Comes through a solid form race last start. Must be included in calculations. PRINCE TOMMY (5) has strong claims after a top-three finish from this box last time out.",
